# Review agent tool for post-commit hook (opencode, claude, codex)
# Defaults to opencode if not set.
# REVIEW_AGENT_TOOL=opencode

# Full site URL (docs/DEPLOYMENT.md): used for canonical URLs, OG images,
# sitemap and robots. Precedence for production builds:
# process env (CI sets this) > .env.production > .env.
# .env.production already pins https://weshall.build, so production builds
# and CI are governed there; a local .env can only override where
# .env.production has no value. Note (dev only): astro.config.mjs reads the
# .env files directly while src/config/site.config.ts uses import.meta.env,
# which in `astro dev` does not load .env.production — dev-server canonicals
# and the config `site` may therefore differ; harmless for this SSG site,
# the built dist/ is always consistent.
# SITE_URL=https://weshall.build
